# Nested SSOT aligned with root .gitignore.
# Track product law, the requirement law molds, product reviews,
# and the checklist directory. Root .gitignore keeps only the four
# product checklists.
*
!.gitignore
!requirements/
!requirements/**
!reviews/
!reviews/**
!checklists/
!checklists/2026-10-22-checklist-logger-folder.md
!checklists/2026-10-22-checklist-log-verbs.md
!checklists/2026-10-22-checklist-tn5250-terminal.md
!checklists/2026-10-22-checklist-gnome-window.md
!templates/
templates/*
!templates/requirements/
!templates/requirements/**
